  guideText: {fileID: 1757430839}
  guideSpec:
  - Stacking two identical emojis might merge them, the maxed-out ones shall be swapped
    clean out of the chat.
  - Try dragging the hands to where they are pointing, the group might go away so
    long as the path is clear
  - ' Try dragging emojis into another of the same family, they might clear up if
    there exists an unobstructed connection path'
  - Try swapping an emoji with another one, same-family neighbors shall be provoked
    to leave.
  - ' Try filling a chat bubble completely with one family, though it only accepts
    new entries sharing the same family'
